\cf2 <script type="application/ld+json">\{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ItemList","itemListElement":[\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/K_iyOw0tt2Y/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Cole Escola | 2025 Tony Awards First Impressions","description":"Tony Award-winner Cole Escola is congratulated by Bonnie Milligan at the Tony Awards First Impressions Cam presented by City National Bank, backstage at the 78th Annual Tony Awards on Sunday, June 8, 2025.\\n\\nAbout the 78th Annual Tony Awards\\n\\nThe American Theatre Wing\'92s 78th Annual Tony Awards, presented by the Broadway League and the American Theatre Wing, aired LIVE on Sunday, June 8, 2025 from Radio City Music Hall from 8:00-11:00 PM, ET/5:00-8:00 PM, PT on the CBS Television Network, and streaming live and on demand on Paramount+*.\\n\\nCBS and Pluto TV presented The Tony Awards: Act One, a pre-show of live, exclusive content leading into the 78th Annual Tony Awards. The celebration commenced at 6:40-8:00 PM, ET/3:30-5:00 PM PT, on Pluto TV.\\n\\n(live and on-demand for Paramount+ with SHOWTIME subscribers, or on-demand for Paramount+ Essential subscribers the day after the special airs).*","uploadDate":"2025-06-09T20:35:40.192Z","duration":"PT4M51S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/K_iyOw0tt2Y","position":1\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G8xeZQCjX6k/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Daniel Radcliffe | 2024 Tony Awards First Impressions","description":"Tony Award-winner Daniel Radcliffe is congratulated by Erich Bergen at the Tony Awards First Impressions Cam presented by City National Bank, backstage at the 77th Annual Tony Awards on Sunday, June 16, 2024.\\n\\nAbout the 77th Annual Tony Awards\\n\\nThe American Theatre Wing\'92s 77th Annual Tony Awards, presented by the Broadway League and the American Theatre Wing, aired LIVE on Sunday, June 16, 2024 from The David H. Koch Theater at Lincoln Center for the Performing Arts from 8:00-11:00 PM, ET/5:00-8:00 PM, PT on the CBS Television Network, and streaming live and on demand on Paramount+*.\\n\\nCBS and Pluto TV presented The Tony Awards: Act One, a pre-show of live, exclusive content leading into the 77th Annual Tony Awards. The celebration commenced at 6:30-8:00 PM, ET/3:30-5:00 PM PT, on Pluto TV.\\n\\n(live and on-demand for Paramount+ with SHOWTIME subscribers, or on-demand for Paramount+ Essential subscribers the day after the special airs).*","uploadDate":"2024-06-17T18:44:34.934Z","duration":"PT3M23S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/G8xeZQCjX6k","position":2\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pI4CQYvOwD8/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Jodie Comer | 2023 Tony Awards First Impressions","description":"Tony Award-winner Jodie Comer is congratulated by Erich Bergen at the Tony Awards First Impressions Cam presented by City National Bank, backstage at the 76th Annual Tony Awards on Sunday, June 11, 2023.\\n\\n*About the 76th Annual Tony Awards*\\nThe American Theatre Wing\'92s 76th Annual Tony Awards, presented by the Broadway League and the American Theatre Wing, aired LIVE on Sunday, June 11, 2023 from the historic United Palace in Washington Heights, in New York City from 8:00-11:00 PM, ET/5:00-8:00 PM, PT on the CBS Television Network, and streaming live and on demand on Paramount+*.\\n\\nCBS and Pluto TV presented The Tony Awards: Act One, a pre-show of live, exclusive content leading into the 76th Annual Tony Awards. The celebration commenced at 6:30-8:00 PM, ET/3:30-5:00 PM PT, on Pluto TV, the leading free streaming television service (FAST).","uploadDate":"2023-06-13T18:38:06.754Z","duration":"PT3M45S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pI4CQYvOwD8","position":3\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XpyvXLCZMOo/mqdefault.jpg","name":"2022 Tony Awards First Impressions | Jesse Tyler Ferguson - Take Me Out","description":"Tony Award-winner Jesse Tyler Ferguson is congratulated by Andrew Keenan-Bolger at the Tony Awards First Impressions Cam presented by City National Bank, backstage at the 75th Annual Tony Awards on Sunday, June 12, 2022.\\n\\n---About the 75th Annual Tony Awards---\\n\\nThe Tony Awards, presented by the Broadway League and the American Theatre Wing, hosted a multi-platform celebration on Sunday, June 12th. Academy Award winner and Tony nominee Ariana DeBose hosted The 75th Annual Tony Awards, aired live coast-to-coast (8:00-11:00 PM, LIVE ET/5:00-8:00 PM, LIVE PT) on the CBS Television Network, and streamed live and on demand on Paramount+. Julianne Hough and Darren Criss hosted \'93The Tony Awards: Act One,\'94 one hour of exclusive content streaming live, only on Paramount+ (7:00-8:00 PM, ET/4:00-5:00 PM, PT.)","uploadDate":"2023-06-06T02:34:21.730Z","duration":"PT1M55S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XpyvXLCZMOo","position":4\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/843j0ATGiFg/mqdefault.jpg","name":"First Impressions: Wayne Brady and Lea Salonga","description":"Minutes after presenting, Wayne Brady and Lea Salonga visited the Tony Awards First Impressions Cam presented by City National Bank, backstage at the 74th Annual Tony Awards on Sunday, September 26, 2021.","uploadDate":"2024-06-25T23:07:11.853Z","duration":"PT2M3S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/843j0ATGiFg","position":5\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G0oyW5uuVoI/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Record-Breaking Signings, March Madness Mayhem & A Severance Waffle Party with Ben Stiller | Ep 130","description":"92%ers we are back with another episode of New Heights presented by Nike! When the world says you can\'92t win, Nike says, \'93So Win\'94 \\n\\nOn today\'92s episode, Jason and Travis weigh in on the latest news from NFL Free Agency including revealing how much players snitch on their old teams, why the Cowboys are fighting online, and if the Bengals made the right call by signing Ja\'92Marr Chase and Tee Higgins to record-breaking contracts. \\n\\nWe also have an incredible conversation with Ben Stiller. We get into everything from the guy's love of \'93Heavyweights\'94, what really happens at NFL training camps, who\'92s idea it was for Tom Cruise to dance in \'93Tropic Thunder\'94, if Ben would give up an Academy Award for a Knicks Title, and all of Jason and Travis\'92 biggest questions about \'93Severance.\'94 \\n\\nFinally, we have potentially the least helpful March Madness breakdown of all time. If your criteria for picking teams involves fighting ability, if they shoot underhand free throws, higher GPAs, or any other broad generalizations, this bracket preview is for you! \\n\\nYou can participate in the New Heights March Madness Bracket Challenge with the links below: \\nMen's Bracket Link: https://bit.ly/NHMensBracket\\nWomen's Bracket Link: https://bit.ly/NHWomensBracket\\n\\nYou can listen to new episodes early and ad-free on Wondery+. Join Wondery+ in the Wondery App, Apple Podcasts or Spotify. \\n.\\n.\\n.\\nDownload the full podcast here:\\nWondery: https://wondery.app.link/s9hHTgtXpMb\\nApple: https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/new-heights/id1643745036\\nSpotify:https://open.spotify.com/show/1y3SUbFMUSESC1N43tBleK?si=LsuQ4a5MRN6wGMcfVcuynw\\n\\nFollow New Heights on Social Media for all the best moments from the show: \\nhttps://lnk.to/newheightshow\\n\\nCheck out all of our new merch\'92 at https://homage.com/newheights\\n\\nSupport the Show: \\n\\nNIKE: When the world says you can\'92t win, Nike says So Win! https://www.nike.com/w/college-teams-2wq2g \\n\\nAMERICAN EXPRESS: For full terms and to learn more about the powerful backing of American Express, visit https://americanexpress.com/withAmex\\n\\nAUDIBLE: Visit https://audible.com/newheights and sign up for a free 30-Day Trial\\n\\nTHE FARMER'S DOG: Get 50% off your first box of fresh, healthy food at https://TheFarmersDog.com/newheights. Plus, you get FREE shipping! \\n\\nALL STATE: Checking first is smart. So, check https://Allstate.com first for a quote that could save you hundreds.\\n\\nDRAFT KINGS: Don\'92t miss out on all the action this week at DraftKings! Download the DraftKings app today! Sign-up using http://dkng.co/newheights or through my promo code NEWHEIGHTS.\\n\\nGAMBLING PROBLEM? CALL 1-800-GAMBLER, (800) 327-5050 or visit gamblinghelplinema.org (MA). Call 877-8-HOPENY/text HOPENY (467369) (NY).Please Gamble Responsibly. 888-789-7777/visit ccpg.org (CT), or visit www.mdgamblinghelp.org (MD). 21+ and present in most states. (18+ DC/KY/NH/WY). Void in ONT/OR/NH.Eligibility restrictions apply. On behalf of Boot Hill Casino & Resort (KS). 1 per new customer. $5+ first-time bet req. Max. $200 issued as non-withdrawable Bonus Bets that expire in 7 days (168 hours). Stake removed from payout. Terms: dkng.co/dk-offer-terms. Ends 3/30/25 at 11:59 PM ET. Sponsored by DK.\\n\\nChapters: \\n\\n00:00 - Intro \\n03:30 - Award-Winning Podcast \\n04:30 - Free Agency Snitching \\n08:15 - Cowboys Twitter Fight\\n10:40 - Chase and Higgins Get Paid \\n16:10 - Shout Out Kyle Frazier \\n20:20 - Ben Stiller Conversation \\n22:20 - Legacy of Heavyweights \\n29:00 - Answering Ben\'92s Biggest NFL Questions \\n37:30 - Could you Make Tropic Thunder Today? \\n41:05 - Enjoying the Process \\n45:50 - Working with Tom Cruise\\n49:20 - Knicks Fandom \\n54:10 - Travis\'92 Favorite Basketball Scene \\n57:30 - Severance Waffle Party \\n01:21:40 - That\'92s Right, A \'93Blank Man\'94 Discussion \\n01:23:30 - Reese\'92s Final Four Debate \\n01:27:00 - New Heights March Madness Bracket Preview\\n\\n#nfl #newheights #traviskelce #jasonkelce #chiefs #eagles #cowboys #bengals #freeagency #benstiller #heavyweights #severance #tropicthunder #tomcruise #MarchMadness","uploadDate":"2025-05-05T14:01:31.984Z","duration":"PT1H43M6S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/G0oyW5uuVoI","position":6\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bCy3RdLHC0Q/mqdefault.jpg","name":"\'91Good Fortune\'92 & Funny Set Confessions with Keanu Reeves, Seth Rogen and Aziz Ansari","description":"Do Keanu Reeves, Seth Rogen, and Aziz Ansari think they have a guardian angel? The stars of the new movie \'91Good Fortune\'92 join their co-star Keke for a convo you won\'92t hear anywhere else: stories of divine intervention, looking five years into the future, and what they would be doing if they weren\'92t in Hollywood. Add in co-star body swap confessions, a few behind-the-scenes secrets and what Keke's auntie REALLY thought of \'91The Matrix\'92?! This one\'92s pure gold.\\n\\nChapters:\\n0:00 - What are they fortunate for? \\n5:31 - Do Seth, Keanu, and Aziz have guardian angels? \\n8:35 - Aziz as a food delivery driver \\n13:43 - Moments that changed their lives \\n20:17 - High school dropouts & early hustle\\n26:55 - Advice for aspiring writers \\n29:47 - Aziz\'92s inspiration for \'91Good Fortune\'92\\n31:01 - Seth's stories from \'91Superbad\'92 \\n35:24 - \'91The Matrix\'92, \'91John Wick\'92 and raising the stakes\\n38:35 - Casting Keanu as the guardian angel \\n43:56 - Behind-the-scenes stories\\n47:17 - Swapping bodies with a castmate?!\\n\\nWatch More Baby, This is Keke Palmer episodes:\\nhttps://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdcezJ2sNeAsmBTdorccSanHejdXRLGC2&si=vya1EmI8LKEcOQDk\\n\\nCheck out Keke's first merch drop by going to kekepalmershop.com\\n\\nFollow Keke on social: \\nhttps://www.instagram.com/keke\\nhttps://www.twitter.com/KekePalmer\\nhttps://www.facebook.com/kekepalmer\\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@kekepalmer\\n\\nConnect with Wondery\\nhttps://wondery.com/shows/baby-this-is-keke-palmer/\\nhttps://facebook.com/WonderyMedia\\nhttps://twitter.com/WonderyMedia\\nhttps://instagram.com/WonderyMedia\\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@wonderymedia\\n\\nAbout the Show:\\nKeke Palmer has questions for days, about everything under the sun. From the existential to the inconsequential, and everything in between. And now she\'92s diving into the brains of entertainment\'92s best and brightest to get some answers. From Snoop Dogg to Jordan Peele to Quinta Brunson, to John Stamos, Keke is getting to the bottom of the burning topics that keep us up at night. This is Keke as her most authentic self, going all in on everything in her life and the lives of her celeb guests, because Baby, this is Keke Palmer, and she is here for All. Of. It. You know it\'92s your girl!\\n\\n#kekepalmer #podcast #wondery #goodfortune #azizansari #keanureeves #sethrogen \\n\\nWatch more of Keke with her 'Good Fortune' co-stars:\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X_2b4qMBXCI&pp=ygUMZ29vZCBmb3J0dW5l\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ixo3N86WZcQ&pp=ygUMZ29vZCBmb3J0dW5l0gcJCfwJAYcqIYzv\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2jb1xQpyWTU&pp=ygUYZ29vZCBmb3J0dW5lIGtla2UgcGFsbWVy","uploadDate":"2025-11-16T16:25:51.632Z","duration":"PT50M21S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bCy3RdLHC0Q","position":7\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/1983280990-7403b3ad22b01e748107a6921cb60ebc94762e392535da80ad7bdf46fa1aeacf-d_1920x1080?&r=pad&region=us","name":"The Bachelor: Granted","description":"The Bachelor: Granted","uploadDate":"2025-02-17T03:25:34.532Z","duration":"PT1M19S","embedUrl":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1056968490","position":8\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MOnGlcd3NxY/mqdefault.jpg","name":"The Queen of Versailles on Broadway","description":"Broadway previews begin October 8 at the St. James Theatre.\\n\\nBased on the wildly astonishing documentary directed by award-winning filmmaker Lauren Greenfield, The Queen of Versailles reunites celebrated Academy Award\'ae\'96winning songwriter Stephen Schwartz with Tony\'ae and Emmy Award\'ae winner Kristin Chenoweth as Jackie Siegel. With a book by Lindsey Ferrentino (Ugly Lies the Bone, Amy and the Orphans) and direction by Tony Award winner Michael Arden (Parade, Once on This Island), The Queen of Versailles is a new musical exploring the true cost of fame, fortune, and family.\\n\\nGet tickets now at queenofversaillesmusical.com!","uploadDate":"2025-06-09T20:35:40.188Z","duration":"PT31S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MOnGlcd3NxY","position":9\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/D1x2rICBtl4/mqdefault.jpg","name":"The Royal We: Queen of Versailles on Broadway","description":"\'93Because in this country, anyone can become American Royalty\'94 says Jackie Siegel. During \'93The Royal We\'94, she dreams of her idol, Marie Antoinette. But the higher the throne, the harder the fall.\\n\\nGet Tickets Today","uploadDate":"2025-11-16T16:24:43.103Z","duration":"PT1M5S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/D1x2rICBtl4","position":10\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/w4xaJxeUIaw/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Golden Hour: The Queen of Versailles on Broadway","description":"Golden Hour: The Queen of Versailles on Broadway","uploadDate":"2025-11-16T16:24:43.095Z","duration":"PT1M10S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/w4xaJxeUIaw","position":11\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NIkG1apqbUU/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Jean Smart in CALL ME IZZY | Now on Broadway","description":"It was always her story to tell...\\n\\nSix-time Emmy\'ae Award winner and Tony Award\'ae nominee Jean Smart is back on Broadway for a limited time only, in a tour-de-force portrayal of a writer whose words are her greatest gift, her biggest secret, and her only way out. Written by Jamie Wax and directed by Sarna Lapine, CALL ME IZZY is a can\'92t-miss theatrical event and a moving portrait of one woman\'92s refusal to be silenced through her own sheer tenacity, humor, and fiery imagination.\\n\\nGet tickets now: https://callmeizzyplay.com/","uploadDate":"2025-06-25T17:44:35.777Z","duration":"PT30S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NIkG1apqbUU","position":12\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"ht