es are not just planning an event; they're creating a legacy of luxury and distinction.\\n\\nVisit us at https://elegantmusicgroup.com/ for more information.","uploadDate":"2024-10-04T21:40:57.945Z","duration":"PT4M9S","embedUrl":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/997344890","position":17\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/O_adESuYNyw/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Happily Ever After will never be the same.","description":"Happily Ever After will never be the same\'97 Previews begin 5.13","uploadDate":"2023-05-02T19:36:16.986Z","duration":"PT16S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/O_adESuYNyw","position":18\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jfy1qGwMuYM/mqdefault.jpg","name":"MACBETH at The Shakespeare Theatre of New Jersey","description":"By William Shakespeare\\nDirected by Brian B. Crowe\\nSpurred on by supernatural solicitings, a noble general and his wife embark on a bloody journey to gain the crown. Their ruthless quest for power rocks a war-torn nation as ambition grows to devastating madness in this epic tragedy which has not been presented as part of STNJ\'92s season in two decades. Don\'92t miss Shakespeare\'92s electrifying and thrilling cautionary tale.\\n
