\f0 : @zipline.media","uploadDate":"2024-10-16T21:55:27.584Z","duration":"PT42S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jfy1qGwMuYM","position":19\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WMuREsrAmSg/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Cult of Love - Behind The Scenes","description":"Get the inside scoop on #CultOfLoveBway\\n\\nGet your tickets at https://2st.com/shows/cult-of-love","uploadDate":"2024-12-02T16:45:14.890Z","duration":"PT1M6S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WMuREsrAmSg","position":20\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rhWWITnK6-s/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Moulin Rouge! The Musical Celebrates 5 Years on Broadway","description":"EVERYBODY CAN-CAN! Our 5-Year Anniversary festivities were beyond spectacular. Thank you for celebrating with us, bohemians. Never forget, YOU are the Moulin Rouge!","uploadDate":"2024-07-29T14:29:03.805Z","duration":"PT42S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rhWWITnK6-s","position":21\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ztz4D8zTpHY/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Heroes of New York Gala | YMCA of Greater New York","description":"Thank You for Attending the YMCA of Greater New York\'92s Heroes of New York Gala!\\n\\nWe are incredibly grateful to everyone who joined us at The Metropolitan Museum of Art on June 13th. The evening was unforgettable with a special performance by Billy Porter and music by Grandmaster Flash, and emceed by Punkie Johnson. \\n\\nWe honored New York Life, Deloitte, and John Starks, and the Rowe Scholars program, which celebrates its 10th anniversary this year.\\n\\nThe inaugural After Party was a blast with an intimate performance by Grandmaster Flash, desserts, and an open bar in The Met\'92s Great Hall.\\n\\nThank you for your generous support, which helps fund our free community programs. Together, we\'92re opening the doors of opportunity for New Yorkers. \\n\\nSee you next year! \\n\\n#YMCA #HeroesOfNewYorkGala #CommunitySupport #BillyPorter #GrandmasterFlash #RoweScholars #TheMet #GalaAfterParty #ThankYou","uploadDate":"2024-07-01T13:50:36.746Z","duration":"PT1M51S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ztz4D8zTpHY","position":22\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7XoQKtD5XDY/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Inside Cult of Love's First Rehearsal","description":"The dinner table is set. Pull up a chair and peek into the first rehearsal of Cult of Love on Broadway. Performances start November 20th.\\n\\nGrab your seat at https://2st.com/shows/cult-of-love","uploadDate":"2024-12-02T16:47:15.597Z","duration":"PT1M5S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7XoQKtD5XDY","position":23\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mV5xdHHtQD0/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Death Becomes Her - Musical Comedy Revitalized","description":"Starring Tony Award nominees Megan Hilty (Wicked, Smash) and Jennifer Simard (Company, Disaster!), Death Becomes Her, based on the classic 1992 film, is a drop-dead hilarious new musical comedy about friendship, love, and burying the hatchet\'85again, and again, and again.\\n\\nComing to Chicago's Cadillac Palace Theatre April 30, 2024.\\n\\nLearn more: DeathBecomesHerBroadway.com","uploadDate":"2023-09-22T14:19:45.190Z","duration":"PT31S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mV5xdHHtQD0","position":24\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/1873950398-3be1e13e43cee9638dca5c72fca9486237d2ef7bc5df874e349386a9426cdb01-d_1920x1080?&r=pad&region=us","name":"A 30-Second Montage of Broadway's Lempicka","description":"A 30-Second Montage of Broadway's Lempicka","uploadDate":"2024-06-18T17:26:07.743Z","duration":"PT30S","embedUrl":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/961298693","position":25\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fovrHNNiF-4/mqdefault.jpg","name":"LEMPICKA on Broadway","description":"One of the world\'92s greatest artists deserves the world\'92s biggest stage: LEMPICKA comes to Broadway on March 19, 2024, following critically acclaimed, sold-out runs at the Williamstown Theatre Festival and the La Jolla Playhouse.\\n\\nFrom the Tony Award\'ae-winning director of HADESTOWN and starring Eden Espinosa, this New York Times Critic\'92s Pick is a sweeping musical portrait of a woman who changed art and culture forever. \\n\\nSpanning decades of political and personal turmoil and told through a thrilling, pop-infused score, LEMPICKA boldly explores the contradictions of a world in crisis, a woman ahead of her era, and an artist whose time has finally come.\\n\\n\'93Eden Espinosa has finally found a part to match her high-voltage talent in this rousing, surprising, intricately shaded portrait of a conquering heroine.\'94 The New York Times\\n\\n\'93A singular boldness pulses through LEMPICKA, a musical that\'92s as ambitious and complex as the painter it frames onstage.\'94 The Los Angeles Times","uploadDate":"2023-10-30T22:26:42.555Z","duration":"PT27S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fovrHNNiF-4","position":26\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Gx_MFlluTYo/mqdefault.jpg","name":"For Her/My Green Light - The Great Gatsby on Broadway","description":"The Great Gatsby begins performances on Broadway March 29. Tickets: www.broadwaygatsby.com\\n\\nTransport yourself to the opulent world of the 1920s as one of the greatest American novels hits the greatest American stage. Starring Jeremy Jordan (Newsies) as the eccentric and mysterious millionaire Jay Gatsby and Eva Noblezada (Hadestown) as the enigmatic Daisy Buchanan, THE GREAT GATSBY arrives on Broadway after a record-shattering, sold-out run at Paper Mill Playhouse. Directed by Marc Bruni (Beautiful: The Carole King Musical), this story of extravagance and longing features choreography by Dominique Kelley (So You Think You Can Dance), a book by Kait Kerrigan (The Mad Ones) and a jazz- and pop-influenced original score by Jason Howland (Little Women) and Nathan Tysen (Paradise Square). Don\'92t miss the party \'97 get tickets today to the musical that The New York Times calls \'93lush, bewitching, and dazzling!\'94\\n\\nTHE GREAT GATSBY is produced by Chunsoo Shin, acclaimed Korean musical producer, 5-time winner of Korea\'92s most prestigious theatrical award and OD Company president.\\n\\nwww.broadwaygatsby.com\\n\\n#bwaygatsby #gatsbybway #gatsbymusical #broadway #musicaltheatre #greatgatsbymusical #greatgatsby #broadway #jeremyjordan #evanoblezada","uploadDate":"2024-03-12T18:58:46.727Z","duration":"PT3M33S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Gx_MFlluTYo","position":27\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TW1ckET5Fgg/mqdefault.jpg","name":"DRAG: The Musical First Look","description":"DRAG: The Musical is now in performances Off-Broadway at New World Stages.\\n\\nTickets available at https://dragthemusical.com/.\\n\\nAbout DRAG: The Musical\\nTwo Drag Houses, both alike in indignity, vie for supremacy in a wig-snatching, diva-licious musical journey of fashion, family, and forgiveness. Leave the lip syncs at the door, darling. Get ready for REAL singing in a REAL theater with REAL DRAMA!\\nAfter a bitter split, fishy queen Alexis Gillmore opened her club, The Fish Tank, while glamourpuss Miss Kitty established The Cathouse. Heels click and tensions rise as old wounds are opened up and the two clubs fight to survive.","uploadDate":"2024-12-02T16:45:14.896Z","duration":"PT55S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TW1ckET5Fgg","position":28\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FXfQzAHPa6g/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Think of Me - The Phantom of the Opera Broadway Cast 2023 [Official Music Video]","description":"Celebrating 35 years on Broadway, the production\'92s lead cast members Ben Crawford (The Phantom), Emilie Kouatchou (Christine), and John Riddle (Raoul) sing Think of Me from The Phantom of the Opera.\\n\\nAccompanied on the piano by Music Director and Conductor David Lai. \\n\\nSheet music available here: https://www.sheetmusicdirect.com/en-US/se/ID_No/1315101/Product.aspx \\n\\nFilmed and recorded at Power Station at BerkleeNYC\\n\\nExperience the power of the phantom with your nearest performance: http://www.thephantomoftheopera.com \\n\\nFollow The Phantom of the Opera everywhere:\\nInstagram: https://instagram.com/phantomopera (West End / Broadway)\\nInstagram: https://instagram.com/potoworldwide (global productions)\\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/PhantomOpera \\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/ThePhantomOfTheOpera\\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@phantommusical \\n\\n\'97--------------\\nFar beneath the majesty and splendour of the Paris Opera House, hides the Phantom in a shadowy existence. Shamed by his physical appearance and feared by all, the love he holds for his beautiful prot\'e9g\'e9e Christine Daa\'e9 is so strong that even her heart cannot resist.\\n\\nAndrew Lloyd Webber\'92s Phantom of the Opera is widely considered one of the most beautiful and spectacular productions in history, playing to over 160 million people in 41 countries and 186 cities in 18 languages.\\n\\nThe musical opened at the Majestic Theatre on Broadway 26 January 1988, closing 16 April 2023.\\n\\n#ThinkOfMe #ThePhantomoftheOpera #AndrewLloydWebber","uploadDate":"2023-04-14T20:10:06.018Z","duration":"PT2M51S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FXfQzAHPa6g","position":29\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rhyiqvVNsUo/mqdefault.jpg","name":"\\"Where I Wanna Be\\" from Boop! The Musical","description":"We snuck into the recording studio with Jasmine Amy Rogers and David Foster! Watch them record \'93Where I Wanna Be\'94 from Boop! The Musical.\\n\'95\\nPerformed by Jasmine Amy Rogers\\nMusic by David Foster\\nLyrics by Susan Birkenhead\\nRecorded at Quad Studios\\nVideo by Zipline Media","uploadDate":"2023-11-14T14:44:38.869Z","duration":"PT2M19S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rhyiqvVNsUo","position":30\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ntYge3kewmQ/mqdefault.jpg","name":"\\"Let Me Be Your Star (Opening Version)\\"| SMASH The Musical","description":"This first look at \'93Let Me Be Your Star (Opening Number Version)\'94 is yours for the taking! And yes, there are multiple versions of the song in the show, but you have to come to the Imperial Theatre to see them!\\n\\nOriginal Broadway cast album coming soon from Concord Theatricals Recordings \\n\\nTickets and more information: www.smashbroadway.com","uploadDate":"2025-02-10T16:12:52.378Z","duration":"PT3M29S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ntYge3kewmQ","position":31\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wCYtx31o2WU/mqdefault.jpg","name":"CHESS the musical: Now Open on Broadway","description":"\'93SIZZLINGLY SEXY AND RIDICULOUSLY FUN, CHESS IS THE BROADWAY SHOW OF THE SEASON!\'94 (Chicago Tribune). \\n\\nTony Award\'ae winner Aaron Tveit (Moulin Rouge!), acclaimed stage and screen star Lea Michele (Funny Girl, Glee), and breakout talent Nicholas Christopher (Sweeney Todd, Hamilton) electrify in this seductive showdown of love, loyalty, and power. As two of the greatest chess players in the world compete for something beyond victory, the woman between them faces a high-stakes battle of desire and devotion.\\n\\n\\"PACKED WITH BLOW-YOUR-HAIR-BACK BANGERS\\" (The Washington Post) by Benny Andersson and Bj\'f6rn Ulvaeus of ABBA and Tim Rice (Evita, Jesus Christ Superstar), a thrilling new book by Danny Strong (Dopesick, The Butler), and direction by Michael Mayer (Hedwig and the Angry Inch, Funny Girl), CHESS is \'93a triumphant checkmate!\'94 (People). \\"SHOULD YOU GO BUY A TICKET RIGHT THIS MINUTE? YES, GOD, ABSOLUTELY!\'94 (New York Magazine).","uploadDate":"2025-11-19T17:23:37.739Z","duration":"PT1M25S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wCYtx31o2WU","position":32\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/m6VjlZsAKNE/mqdefault.jpg","name":"'If I Were a Bird' Performed by Joy Huerta (of Jesse and Joy) and Aline Mayagoitia","description":"Co-composed by Joy Huerta (of Jesse and Joy) and Benjamin Velez, 'If I Were a Bird' is a song about two girls who are becoming friends. They are bonding over the ways life is shitting on them and what they would do if they could fly. This song is inspired by \'93Freedom\'94 by Guatemalan poet Humberto Ak\uc0\u700 abal (1952-2019). Performed by: Aline Mayagoitia, Joy Huerta, Nadia DiGiallonardo, Rich Mercurio, and Yair Evnine.\\n\\nREAL WOMEN HAVE CURVES: THE MUSICAL is a funny, joyous, and empowering new show coming to Broadway this April. It\'92s the summer of 1987, and Ana Garcia dreams of flying away from East Los Angeles. But when her family\'92s garment business receives a make-or-break order for 200 dresses, Ana finds herself juggling her own ambitions, her mother\'92s expectations, and a community of women all trying to make it work against the odds. Based on the play by Josefina L\'f3pez that inspired the iconic hit film, REAL WOMEN HAVE CURVES: THE MUSICAL is \'93a winner, with a big heart and joyous abandon\'94 (The Boston Globe). \'93It makes us feel we can all soar!\'94 (WBUR)\\n\\nTickets now on sale at RealWomenHaveCurvesBroadway.com!","uploadDate":"2024-12-19T19:52:55.898Z","duration":"PT2M58S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/m6VjlZsAKNE","position":33\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pIoJRMK0wcw/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Real Women Have Curves: The Musical I Original Broadway Cast Recording (Official Album Trailer)","description":"Real Women Have Curves: The Musical I Original Broadway Cast Recording (Official Album Trailer)\\n\\nPre-order or Pre-Save:\\nrealwomenhavecurves.lnk.to/OrignalBroadwayCastAlbum\\n\\nHailed as \\"One of the most relevant musicals of the year\\" \'96 Time Out New York, and featuring \\"A hummable score that sounds variously of Mexico, Broadway and American pop\\" \'96 New York Times. This groundbreaking musical, with a Tony-nominated score by Grammy-winning Joy Huerta (of the Mexican pop duo Jesse & Joy- Warner Latin) and Benjamin Velez, celebrates the strength, dreams, and unbreakable bonds of a community of Mexican-American women in East Los Angeles.\\n\\nFollow Real Women Have Curves: The Musical\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/rwhcmusical/\\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@rwhcmusical\\nhttps://www.facebook.com/RWHCMusical\\n\\nSubscribe for more content from Ghostlight Records\\nhttps://ghostlightrecords.lnk.to/YTSubscribeID\\n\\nFollow Ghostlight Records\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/ghostlightrecords/\\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@ghostlightrecords\\nhttps://twitter.com/GhostlightRcrds\\nhttps://www.facebook.com/ghostlightrecords\\nhttps://www.ghostlightrecords.com/","uploadDate":"2025-06-09T20:35:40.197Z","duration":"PT2M30S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pIoJRMK0wcw","position":34\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VEtXCE-t0HI/mqdefault.jpg","name":"In The Recording Studio with BOOP! The Musical","description":"Sneak peek at our Original Broadway Cast Recording with David Foster!","uploadDate":"2025-02-18T15:44:46.366Z","duration":"PT48S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VEtXCE-t0HI","position":35\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/1730690040-d3e2460ace9b72d043cad99370f13fc4cc10c635a8e625455611c53d8199e7d8-d_1920x1080?&r=pad&region=us","name":"Behind-The-Scenes with Betty Boop","description":"Behind-The-Scenes with Betty Boop","uploadDate":"2026-01-21T08:19:55.738Z","duration":"PT24S","embedUrl":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/868853252","position":36\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3XLd9WYlfI0/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Opening Night - JUST IN TIME is \\"A SMASH HIT!\\" | Now on Broadway","description":"NOW ON BROADWAY | Get Tickets Now: https://justintimebroadway.com/\\n\\n\'93JONATHAN GROFF IS SENSATIONAL! Thrilling sonically and emotionally, he gives one of BROADWAY\'92S BEST PERFORMANCES.\'94 The New York Times \\n\\n\'93A DAZZLING AND IMMERSIVE LOVE LETTER TO LIVE PERFORMANCE.\'94 The Washington Post\\n\\nLook out, Jonathan\'92s back! Tony Award\'ae winner Jonathan Groff (Merrily We Roll Along, Hamilton) returns to Broadway this spring as Bobby Darin, the legendary singer whose short but remarkable life took him from teen idol to global sensation. Developed and directed by Tony Award winner Alex Timbers (Moulin Rouge), Just In Time is an exhilarating new musical that immerses audiences in an intimate, swinging nightclub complete with a live band, a stellar ensemble cast, and iconic Bobby Darin hits including \'93Beyond the Sea,\'94 \'93Mack the Knife,\'94 \'93Splish Splash,\'94 and \'93Dream Lover.\'94 Discover the man behind the music \'97 a once-in-a-lifetime talent who knew his time was limited and was determined to make a splash before it was too late.\\n\\n[4 STARS] \'93ONE OF THE MOST WONDROUS MUSICALS OF THE SEASON AND A WALLOP OF JOY! Director Alex Timbers and his irrepressible star Jonathan Groff have made magic.\'94 New York Post","uploadDate":"2025-05-05T14:01:31.975Z","duration":"PT1M35S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3XLd9WYlfI0","position":37\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9QCHsiR8QrQ/mqdefault.jpg","name":"The Most BROADWAY Broadway Opening Night | SMASH The Musical","description":"Step inside Broadway\'92s most BROADWAY opening night. #SmashBway is here and it\'92s a New York Times Critic\'92s Pick!\\n\\nTickets and more information: www.smashbroadway.com","uploadDate":"2025-05-05T14:01:31.960Z","duration":"PT1M48S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9QCHsiR8QrQ","position":38\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2OktQGbpOcY/mqdefault.jpg","name":"FLOYD COLLINS - Go Inside Opening Night","description":"This is How Glory Goes! Go inside Opening Night with the cast and creators of FLOYD COLLINS! \\n\\n#FloydCollins","uploadDate":"2025-05-05T14:01:31.996Z","duration":"PT1M15S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2OktQGbpOcY","position":39\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iDGEXosGibs/mqdefault.jpg","name":"McNEAL - Go Inside Opening Night with the Cast!","description":"McNEAL is now playing at Lincoln Center Theater through November 24 only! \\n\\nGet tickets and more info at mcnealbroadway.com","uploadDate":"2024-10-07T20:34:01.216Z","duration":"PT1M27S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iDGEXosGibs","position":40\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/H8xeyf3WUY0/mqdefault.jpg","name":"McNEAL Opening Night - get a sneak peek!","description":"See who joined us at the Opening Night of McNEAL! \\n\\nNow playing through November 24 only! Tickets and more info: mcnealbroadway.com","uploadDate":"2024-10-02T00:30:33.134Z","duration":"PT46S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/H8xeyf3WUY0","position":41\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TK3NL7g5O0o/mqdefault.jpg","name":"THE HILLS OF CALIFORNIA | Opening Night!","description":"THE HILLS OF CALIFORNIA | Opening Night!","uploadDate":"2024-10-04T21:45:57.485Z","duration":"PT1M30S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TK3NL7g5O0o","position":42\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/by_YKHMJ8zM/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Walden Opening Night","description":"Take a look inside WALDEN's opening night! Just two weeks left to see Amy Berryman\'92s compassionate drama. 
\f2 \uc0\u55356 \u57102 
\f0  Running now through November 24.\\n\\nGet tickets at https://2st.com/","uploadDate":"2024-12-02T16:47:15.590Z","duration":"PT1M32S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/by_YKHMJ8zM","position":43\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nCeEoEZuql8/mqdefault.jpg","name":"An Opening Night Fairytale | Once Upon A Mattress on Broadway","description":"WE\'92RE GONNA NEED A BIGGER MOAT\'85\\n\\nDirect from its sold-old, record-breaking New York City Center Encores! run, Once Upon a Mattress returns to Broadway for the first time since 1996. Two-time Tony\'ae winner Sutton Foster gives what The New York Times calls an \'93ebullient, joyful, perfectly goofy\'94 performance as Princess Winnifred the Woebegone alongside royalty of stage and screen, Michael Urie.\\n\\nNewly adapted by Amy Sherman-Palladino (The Marvelous Mrs. Maisel), this New York Times Critic\'92s Pick introduces the unapologetically eccentric Winnifred to a repressed kingdom, where she charms, delights, and dances her way to the top\'85 of a stack of mattresses.\\n\\nBook your tickets at OnceUponAMattress.com now to this uproarious production \'96 \'93it will restore your fealty to the throne!\'94 (Observer).","uploadDate":"2024-10-04T21:45:57.492Z","duration":"PT1M31S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nCeEoEZuql8","position":44\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Kya8YUZxXAM/mqdefault.jpg","name":"OPENING NIGHT | Gutenberg! The Musical","description":"Rumors were SWIRLING at the opening night of Gutenberg! The Musical The truth? You\'92ll have to see it to believe it.\\n\\nA Hilarious New Musical About An Unintentionally Hilarious New Musical!\\nJosh Gad and Andrew Rannells\'97who became pretty famous on Broadway and then extremely super famous out in Hollywood\'97have come back to their musical theater roots, putting on a show together because they just love each other so damn much. And what did they pick? A hilarious new musical from the guys who wrote Beetlejuice and the guy who directed Beetlejuice and Moulin Rouge. It\'92s the story of two best pals named Bud and Doug who put on a show together because they just love each other so damn much. It\'92s art imitating life imitating art! And it\'92s the funniest thing to come to Broadway since 1448! (Which is the year the printing press was invented by Johannes Gutenberg, who is the subject of the musical that Bud and Doug write, but that\'92s not important right now.)\\n\\nTickets and more information: https://gutenbergbway.com/","uploadDate":"2023-10-16T13:52:57.866Z","duration":"PT1M31S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Kya8YUZxXAM","position":45\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DnGR9dSFkmA/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Opening Night | Dead Outlaw on Broadway","description":"Calling all outlaws to the Longacre. DEAD OUTLAW\'96now a New York Times critics pick and \\"the best musical of the decade\\" (USA Today)\'96is open on Broadway. \\n\\nDirected by David Cromer, DEAD OUTLAW is the darkly hilarious and wildly inventive musical about the bizarre true story of outlaw-turned-corpse-turned-celebrity Elmer McCurdy. As Elmer\'92s body finds even more outlandish adventures in death than it could have ever hoped for in life, the show explores fame, failure, and the meaning\'97or, utter meaninglessness\'97of legacy. Dying is no reason to stop living life to its fullest.\\n\\nGet tickets today.","uploadDate":"2025-05-05T14:01:31.954Z","duration":"PT1M21S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DnGR9dSFkmA","position":46\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bRc5N7eIeuU/mqdefault.jpg","name":"LEMPICKA | Opening Night on Broadway","description":"A hundred years ago, Tamara de Lempicka sat down at a canvas to paint a new world. Last night, at our opening night on Broadway, we raised a glass to her. \\n\\nOne of the world\'92s greatest artists deserves the world\'92s biggest stage: LEMPICKA comes to Broadway on March 19, 2024, following critically acclaimed, sold-out runs at the Williamstown Theatre Festival and the La Jolla Playhouse.\\n\\nFrom the Tony Award\'ae-winning director of HADESTOWN and starring Eden Espinosa, this New York Times Critic\'92s Pick is a sweeping musical portrait of a woman who changed art and culture forever. \\n\\nSpanning decades of political and personal turmoil and told through a thrilling, pop-infused score, LEMPICKA boldly explores the contradictions of a world in crisis, a woman ahead of her era, and an artist whose time has finally come.\\n\\n\'93Eden Espinosa has finally found a part to match her high-voltage talent in this rousing, surprising, intricately shaded portrait of a conquering heroine.\'94 The New York Times\\n\\n\'93A singular boldness pulses through LEMPICKA, a musical that\'92s as ambitious and complex as the painter it frames onstage.\'94 The Los Angeles Times\\n\\nTickets and more information: https://lempickamusical.com/","uploadDate":"2024-04-16T22:24:04.757Z","duration":"PT1M28S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bRc5N7eIeuU","position":47\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/17cRECRE4Nk/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Broadway Meet and Greet | Gutenberg! The Musical","description":"Get an inside look at the Gutenberg! Broadway meet and greet... Turns out when you're in a two-man show, you end up with alooooot of bagels.\\n\\nTickets and More information: https://gutenbergbway.com/\\n\\nA Hilarious New Musical About An Unintentionally Hilarious New Musical!\\nNeed we say more? Okay we will! Josh Gad and Andrew Rannells\'97who became pretty famous on Broadway and then extremely super famous out in Hollywood\'97are coming back to their musical theater roots, putting on a show together because they just love each other so damn much. And what did they pick? A hilarious new musical from the guys who wrote BEETLEJUICE and the guy who directed BEETLEJUICE and MOULIN ROUGE. It\'92s the story of two best pals named Bud and Doug who put on a show together because they just love each other so damn much. It\'92s art imitating life imitating art! And it\'92s the funniest thing to come to Broadway since 1448! (Which is the year the printing press was invented by Johannes Gutenberg, who is the subject of the musical that Bud and Doug write, but that\'92s not important right now.)","uploadDate":"2023-09-05T16:41:41.046Z","duration":"PT50S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/17cRECRE4Nk","position":48\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/h4LY5dXCw6s/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Red Carpet Celebration
\f1 \'a6\'f2
\f0 Merrily We Roll Along on Broadway","description":"It's the best thing that ever could have happened! MERRILY is now open on Broadway and critics agree \'97 it's a hit! \\n\\n\'93IT'S A HIT. MARIA FRIEDMAN'S STAGING BRINGS STEPHEN SONDHEIM'S\\nBRILLIANT, INGENIOUS SCORE FULLY ALIVE \'97 and with DANIEL RADCLIFFE, JONATHAN GROFF and LINDSAY MENDEZ as the show's central trio, it is perfectly cast.\'94\\n\\nTickets and more information: https://merrilyonbroadway.com","uploadDate":"2023-10-12T01:44:46.687Z","duration":"PT1M57S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/h4LY5dXCw6s","position":49\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nadDdEpnBdI/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Lea Salonga and David Korins Tour the Broadway Theatre for Here Lies Love","description":"Lea Salonga and David Korins Tour the Broadway Theatre for Here Lies Love","uploadDate":"2023-03-30T17:49:56.157Z","duration":"PT2M21S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nadDdEpnBdI","position":50\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/1678158461-38d01ecdd3970ecfd48fb9c61954d0ee3e99c171662848f26020345f49c1b5d2-d_1920x1080?&r=pad&region=us","name":"Bringing The Sign in Brustein's Window to Broadway","description":"Bringing The Sign in Brustein's Window to Broadway","uploadDate":"2026-01-21T08:19:55.741Z","duration":"PT33S","embedUrl":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/832342962","position":51\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X5qVexsouPk/mqdefault.jpg","name":"Opening Night with Real Women Have Curves: The Musical","description":"Celebrate with us! Real Women Have Curves: The Musical is officially open on Broadway at the James Earl Jones Theatre. Get ahead of the curve and get your tickets at realwomenhavecurvesbroadway.com!","uploadDate":"2025-05-05T14:01:31.969Z","duration":"PT1M19S","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/X5qVexsouPk","position":52\},\{"@type":"VideoObject","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/